---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Nutritious Diet — GWE NGO INDIA"
  description="GWE NGO India sponsors elderly women so they can live a nutritious life without begging."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Nutritious Diet</h1>
        <p>Sponsoring elderly women who have no one left to care for them.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <img class="page-image" src="/images/nutritious-diet.webp" alt="Nutritious diet support for elders" loading="lazy" />
        <p>
          Women in their old age who have to live alone, away from their families, do not have the
          power to earn money or do something for their livelihood, they have reached an age where
          they require rest and support which they search in the eyes of people around them, some
          women have worked very hard to raise their children but their children now do not take
          care of their mothers. These mothers have no option other than to beg on streets. If we
          all come together to help them get a descent livelihood, then they won't have to beg and
          this way we'll not only be supporting them but our country as a whole.
        </p>
        <p>
          On seeing what these women are going through, GWE NGO India decided to take up the program
          of sponsoring elderly women. Be a part of this effort and help them live a nutritious
          life.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/donate">Sponsor an Elder</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
